/Alt (This figure shows two images. The left image shows a water faucet and sink. Clean dishes sit drying on a towel next to the sink. Around the sink lie a dish cloth and brush as well as a bottle of washing up liquid. The faucet consists of a curved pipe through which water flows into the sink. On the side of the pipe, there is a lever to control the flow of water. The right image shows Thorie's hand opening the lever that controls the faucet. She pushes it outwards, away from the pipe, which released the flow of water.␀)
/K 1
